{"id":"c451bdb5ed075538","group":"28","path":"28/28-ex-singleton-property-not-large.md","title":"单一目标真值表性质不满足 largeness","display":"ex-singleton-property-not-large — 单一目标真值表性质不满足 largeness","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-ex-singleton-property-not-large","aliases":["28-ex-singleton-property-not-large"],"display":"ex-singleton-property-not-large — 单一目标真值表性质不满足 largeness","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Example 23.2 second predicate","source_printed_pages":"499–500","source_pdf_pages":"525–526","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-ex-singleton-property-not-large"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-ex-singleton-property-not-large</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-singleton-property-not-large — 单一目标真值表性质不满足 largeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Example 23.2 second predicate"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"499–500"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"525–526"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n=\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B_n=\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_n\\in\\mathcal B_n\">\\(f_n\\in\\mathcal B_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n\">\\(P_n\\)</span> 是下式定义的目标等同性谓词，g 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n\">\\(\\mathcal B_n\\)</span> 上均匀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_n(g)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\{f_n\\}}(g),\\qquad\\Pr_g[P_n(g)=1]=2^{-2^n}&lt;\\frac1n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_n(g)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\{f_n\\}}(g),\\qquad\\Pr_g[P_n(g)=1]=2^{-2^n}&lt;\\frac1n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>见证只有目标函数 f_n 本身，故通过函数数目精确计算概率。原书取 f_n 为 3SAT 在长度 n 的特征函数，构造性可由逐个输入暴力核对得到；这里隔离与目标计算复杂度无关的 largeness 失效机制。未以此推出 3SAT 的任何未知电路下界。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Example 23.2 second predicate；印刷页 499–500；PDF 页 525–526。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n=\\{g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f_n\\in\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"P_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"P_n(g)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\{f_n\\}}(g),\\qquad\\Pr_g[P_n(g)=1]=2^{-2^n}<\\frac1n.","display":true}],"bytes":1419,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-419","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound]]、[[28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere]]、[[28-df-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]、[[28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound]]、[[28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness]]、[[28-ex-singleton-property-not-large]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}